<!--
The authored original of the scene editor example's page. Read on the first
boot only: `scene_editor.bsx` forks what this builds into `scene.json` beside
it, and every later boot is the fork. Edit this file to change what a fresh
fork starts from; edit the running page to change the fork.
-->
<main>
	<h1>Garden</h1>
	<p>Every entity on this page is in a scene document, and the editor below edits that document: the world follows, one component at a time.</p>
	<h2>Beds</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>carrots</li>
		<li>beets</li>
		<li>kale</li>
	</ul>
	<ToggleSceneEditor/>
</main>
